  <ProfessionalSummary>覆盖膨胀水箱低位报警、自动补水接口及液位维持功能，确保冷却水系统在泄漏或蒸发工况下正常运行。</ProfessionalSummary>
  <EngineeringRequirements count="3">
    <Requirement id="ER-P094-01" level="1" requirementType="alarm_protection">
      <sysml:Name>膨胀水箱低位报警</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>膨胀水箱应设置低液位报警装置，当液位降至设定低位时，应在集控室和驾驶台发出声光报警。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="commissioning_check" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P094" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-EXP-CAP-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-CTRL-COOL-002" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-ISO8861-002" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-EXP-ALARM-008" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>verified_by_direct_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>无法及时发现液位下降，可能导致冷却水循环中断，主机过热损坏。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>检查设计图纸确认低液位报警装置配置。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>调试期间模拟低液位，确认报警信号在集控室和驾驶台正确显示。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【膨胀水箱低位报警】，来自原始需求「低位报警」。E-EXP-CAP-001（DNV规则）支撑低液位报警要求；E-CTRL-COOL-002（IACS UR E10）支撑报警接入集控室和驾驶台；E-ISO8861-002（ISO 8861）支撑报警显示位置；E-EXP-ALARM-008（厂家项目指南）支撑低液位报警开关配置。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
