    <Requirement id="ER-P094-02" level="1" requirementType="operation">
      <sysml:Name>膨胀水箱自动补水接口</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>膨胀水箱应设置自动补水接口，当液位低于设定低位时，应能自动启动补水阀向水箱补水。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="commissioning_check" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P094" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-SOLAS-INCL-001" supportStatus="need_confirmation" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>need_confirmation</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>无法自动补水，需人工干预，增加运维负担，可能因补水不及时导致系统缺水。</RiskIfUnmet>
        <ApplicabilityConstraint>自动补水阀的开启液位和补水速率按主机厂家 Technical Data 确认。</ApplicabilityConstraint>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>检查设计图纸确认自动补水接口及控制逻辑。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>调试期间模拟低液位，确认补水阀自动开启并补水至正常液位。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【膨胀水箱自动补水接口】，来自原始需求「自动补水接口」。E-SOLAS-INCL-001（SOLAS Reg.26）间接支撑液位维持需求，但未直接规定自动补水接口；其他直接证据未明确提及自动补水功能，故需厂家确认。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
